# ProximaDB Core Architecture Diagrams

## System Architecture
```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph "Clients"
        C1[REST API Clients]
        C2[gRPC Clients]
        C3[SDK Clients]
    end
    
    subgraph "ProximaDB Server"
        subgraph "API Layer"
            REST[REST Server :5678]
            GRPC[gRPC Server :5679]
            AUTH[Auth Middleware]
        end
        
        subgraph "Service Layer"
            VS[VectorOperationsService]
            CS[CollectionService]
            ES[EventLogService]
        end
        
        subgraph "Storage Layer"
            MT[MemTable]
            AXIS[AXIS Index]
            ENG[Storage Engines]
        end
        
        subgraph "Persistence"
            WAL[Write-Ahead Log]
            META[Metadata Store]
        end
    end
    
    subgraph "Storage Backends"
        FS[Local Filesystem]
        S3[AWS S3]
        AZURE[Azure Blob]
        GCS[Google Cloud Storage]
    end
    
    C1 --> REST
    C2 --> GRPC
    C3 --> REST & GRPC
    REST & GRPC --> AUTH
    AUTH --> VS & CS & ES
    VS & CS --> MT & AXIS
    MT --> ENG
    ENG --> WAL & META
    WAL & META --> FS & S3 & AZURE & GCS
```

## Data Flow
```mermaid
flowchart LR
    subgraph "Write Path"
        W1[Client Request] --> W2[Validate]
        W2 --> W3[Write WAL]
        W3 --> W4[Insert MemTable]
        W4 --> W5[Return Success]
        W4 --> W6[Background Flush]
        W6 --> W7[Storage Engine]
    end
    
    subgraph "Read Path"
        R1[Search Request] --> R2[Query Optimizer]
        R2 --> R3{Index Available?}
        R3 -->|Yes| R4[Query Index]
        R3 -->|No| R5[Scan Storage]
        R4 --> R6[Fetch Vectors]
        R5 --> R6
        R6 --> R7[Rank Results]
        R7 --> R8[Return Top-K]
    end
```

## Storage Engine Selection
```mermaid
graph TD
    START[Workload Type] --> OLTP{OLTP?}
    OLTP -->|Yes| SST[SST Engine<br/>Row-based<br/>Fast writes]
    OLTP -->|No| OLAP{OLAP?}
    OLAP -->|Yes| VIPER[VIPER Engine<br/>Columnar<br/>High compression]
    OLAP -->|No| MIXED{Mixed?}
    MIXED -->|Yes| NOVA[NOVA Engine<br/>Hybrid format]
    MIXED -->|No| STREAM{Streaming?}
    STREAM -->|Yes| SWIFT[SWIFT Engine<br/>High throughput]
    STREAM -->|No| PRISM[PRISM Engine<br/>Memory optimized]
```

## Hardware Acceleration
```mermaid
graph LR
    REQ[Request] --> DETECT{Hardware?}
    DETECT --> CPU{CPU Type}
    DETECT --> GPU{GPU Available?}
    
    CPU -->|x86| SIMD{SIMD?}
    CPU -->|ARM| NEON[NEON Instructions]
    
    SIMD -->|AVX-512| AVX512[AVX-512 Kernel]
    SIMD -->|AVX2| AVX2[AVX2 Kernel]
    SIMD -->|SSE| SSE[SSE Kernel]
    SIMD -->|None| SCALAR[Scalar Code]
    
    GPU -->|NVIDIA| CUDA[CUDA Kernel]
    GPU -->|AMD| ROCM[ROCm Kernel]
    GPU -->|Apple| MPS[Metal Kernel]
    GPU -->|None| CPUONLY[CPU Only]
```

## Index Types (AXIS)
```mermaid
graph TB
    QUERY[Query] --> SIZE{Dataset Size}
    
    SIZE -->|<10K| FLAT[FLAT<br/>Exact search]
    SIZE -->|10K-100K| IVF[IVF<br/>Clustering]
    SIZE -->|100K-1M| HNSW[HNSW<br/>Graph-based]
    SIZE -->|>1M| PQ[PQ<br/>Quantization]
    
    FLAT --> RESULT[Results]
    IVF --> RESULT
    HNSW --> RESULT
    PQ --> RESULT
```

## Deployment Architecture
```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph "Single Server"
        SINGLE[ProximaDB<br/>All components]
    end
    
    subgraph "High Availability"
        LB[Load Balancer]
        PRIMARY[Primary Server]
        STANDBY[Standby Server]
        SHARED[Shared Storage]
        
        LB --> PRIMARY
        LB -.-> STANDBY
        PRIMARY --> SHARED
        STANDBY --> SHARED
    end
    
    subgraph "Distributed"
        ROUTER[Query Router]
        SHARD1[Shard 1]
        SHARD2[Shard 2]
        SHARD3[Shard 3]
        
        ROUTER --> SHARD1
        ROUTER --> SHARD2
        ROUTER --> SHARD3
    end
```